          "headersSize": -1,
          "httpVersion": "HTTP/1.1",
          "method": "POST",
          "postData": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"contentId\":3,\"promptVersionId\":3,\"prompt\":\"Create a premium 22-25 second vertical 9:16 Pompom Hills Instagram Reel.\\n\\nMAIN CHARACTER:\\nLUCA - official reference exactly.\\n\\nGUEST:\\nZIPO - original tiny friendly alien: soft mint-green skin, one large central eye, two small antennae, tiny rounded body, glowing blue wrist light. Cute, non-scary, no franchise resemblance.\\n\\nSETTING:\\nPompom Hills garden at night.\\n\\n0.0-1.2 SEC - HARD HOOK\\nLuca looks through toy binoculars at stars.\\nA beam sweeps across grass.\\nWHOOSH - soft POP.\\nZipo drops gently into bush.\\nLuca: \\\"WHAT WAS THAT?!\\\"\\nZipo pops up.\\nZipo: \\\"Blip?\\\"\\n\\n1.2-5.0 SEC\\nLuca kneels.\\nLuca: \\\"You're an alien!\\\"\\nZipo points to Luca: \\\"Blip blop?\\\"\\nLuca: \\\"I'm Luca.\\\"\\nZipo taps chest: \\\"Zipo!\\\"\\n\\n5.0-11.0 SEC - EARTH TOUR\\nLuca shows flower. Zipo sniffs too hard and sneezes.\\nLuca shows ladybird. Zipo salutes it.\\nLuca gives biscuit. Zipo scans it before eating.\\nLuca: \\\"Welcome to Pompom Hills.\\\"\\nZipo: \\\"Blip blop!\\\"\\n\\n11.0-17.0 SEC - EMOTIONAL TURN\\nLarger soft blue beam appears. Zipo's wrist light flashes.\\nZipo becomes sad.\\nLuca: \\\"They found you?\\\"\\nZipo: \\\"Blip.\\\"\\nLuca: \\\"I'll miss you.\\\"\\n\\n17.0-22.0 SEC\\nThey hug. Zipo floats upward. Luca waves.\\n\\n22.0-25.0 SEC - TWIST\\nLuca enters room sadly.\\nA small glowing stone sits on desk.\\nIt lights up.\\nZipo voice: \\\"Blip blop, Luca!\\\"\\nLuca beams.\\nCUT.\\n\\nNo narration. No on-screen text.\\n\",\"sourcePath\":\"\",\"options\":{\"profile\":\"post-family-v1\",\"contentProfile\":\"AUTO\",\"openingStrategy\":\"AUTO\",\"generator\":\"AUTO\",\"desiredDuration\":null,\"qualityJustification\":\"\",\"viewerQuestion\":\"\",\"plannedEditedDuration\":null,\"structuredPlan\":null,\"intentRequirements\":[{\"id\":\"farewell\",\"level\":\"ESSENTIAL\",\"eventIds\":[\"source_4\"],\"rationale\":\"Yak\u0131nl\u0131k ve ayr\u0131l\u0131k deneyiminin planlanan merkezi olay\u0131\",\"sourceSpan\":[1092,1133],\"sourceQuote\":\"They hug. Zipo floats upward. Luca waves.\"}],\"creativeEvidence\":[{\"promise\":\"CONCRETE\",\"dimension\":\"OPENING\",\"rationale\":\"Y\u0131ld\u0131zlara bakan \u00e7ocu\u011fun dikkatini \u00e7eken \u0131\u015f\u0131n, kim geliyor sorusunu planl\u0131yor; ilk kare tam mekanizmay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131klamak zorunda de\u011fil.\",\"assessment\":\"READABLE_EARLY_DEVELOPMENT\",\"sourceSpan\":[388,459],\"sourceQuote\":\"Luca looks through toy binoculars at stars.\\nA beam sweeps across grass.\",\"visualFocus\":\"READABLE\",\"causeAtFrameZero\":\"UNEXPLAINED\"},{\"dimension\":\"PROGRESSION\",\"rationale\":\"Tan\u0131\u015fma ve birlikte ke\u015fiften ayr\u0131l\u0131k kayg\u0131s\u0131na ge\u00e7i\u015f, izleme deneyimini daha fazla fiziksel karma\u015fa gerektirmeden de\u011fi\u015ftiriyor.\",\"assessment\":\"DEVELOPING\",\"mechanisms\":[\"EMOTIONAL\",\"RELATIONAL\"],\"sourceSpan\":[998,1076],\"sourceQuote\":\"Zipo becomes sad.\\nLuca: \\\"They found you?\\\"\\nZipo: \\\"Blip.\\\"\\nLuca: \\\"I'll miss you.\\\"\"},{\"dimension\":\"ENDING\",\"functions\":[\"EMOTIONAL_SATISFACTION\",\"REVEAL\",\"CALLBACK\"],\"rationale\":\"Plan\u0131n masa ta\u015f\u0131 ve tan\u0131d\u0131k ses d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f\u00fc ayr\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 yeniden \u00e7er\u00e7eveliyor; ger\u00e7ek ses/video kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 ayr\u0131ca do\u011frulanmal\u0131.\",\"assessment\":\"DELIVERS_PROMISE\",\"sourceSpan\":[1157,1273],\"sourceQuote\":\"Luca enters room sadly.\\nA small glowing stone sits on desk.\\nIt lights up.\\nZipo voice: \\\"Blip blop, Luca!\\\"\\nLuca beams.\"}],\"intentChangeReason\":\"\",\"protectedIntent\":[],\"references\":[],\"settings\":{\"mode\":\"image2video\",\"aspectRatio\":\"9:16\",\"resolution\":\"480p\"},\"segments\":[]}}"
          },
